\section{Borrowing and lending with rate spreads} 
%\subsection{Nonlinear pricing framework for the lending contract} 

In this section, we analyse pricing and hedging  \emph{from the borrower's perspective} of a loan contract under different rates for borrowing and lending. Classical non-arbitrage pricing presented in section \ref{no spread} no longer applies in this setting, and non-linear pricing theory, see \cite{el1997backward,dumitrescu2019optional} is required. 
