The underlying alternatives that are represented by the non-aggregated alternatives are $\tilde{X}=\{\text{Kellogg Corn Flakes, $\cdots$, Quaker Life}\}$; the underlying alternatives that compose the aggregated alternatives are $X^*=\{\text{Omelette, Pancakes}\}$.
\end{exmp}


