%These approaches effectively address challenges intrinsic to the analog combiner and support the integration of the MP technique within the HAD architecture. 
%Our proposed algorithms address spatial sector challenges and enable MP operation within the hybrid architecture. Moreover, to overcome the challenge posed by a limited number of snapshots and the aforementioned challenges arising from the conventional analog combiner, we introduce a novel analog combiner structure functioning as an all-pass filter, effectively detecting all DoAs, even in scenarios where traditional analog combiners encounter limitations. Performance evaluation involves comparing Cram\'{e}r-Rao lower bounds~(CRLB) with simulation results, highlighting the effectiveness and superiority of our proposed architecture and algorithms over existing state-of-the-art techniques.
