\section{Proposed MPM-based Approaches for DoA Estimation in HAD Receivers}\label{sec:proposed techs}
In this section, we develop two MPM-based approaches for DoA estimation in HAD receivers. These approaches will result in Hankel matrices that can used to extract the DoAs using the MPM. These approaches will also eliminate the potential of heavy attenuation which the received signals may be subjected to, otherwise. 
We begin by considering the noiseless case with a single snapshot and then extend these approaches to multiple snapshots in the presence of noise.
