are constructed from distinct, rather than identical, columns of the DFT matrix. Using identical columns of the DFT matrix in the  PC-HAD analog combiners will enable using the  MPM to extract the DoAs embedded in the received signals, cf. Sections~\ref{sec:PMP}--\ref{sec:SPC} below.
